ragraph","text":"ただ、せっせと動いてるだけでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬眠前のリス とか言われるの...( ･ิω･ิ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでぇぇー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ前にモバメでも、ふとしたときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんと手を繋いでる写真送ったことあったね（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、人見知りだけど、慣れるとすごい懐くタイプ。(　・´ｰ・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時、ひめたんの膝に手を置いてたら、ひめたんがその手を握ってきてくれたんだ( //^o^// )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、温泉が苦手らしいけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私とまりかとだけは、一緒に入ってくれる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46SHOW! 見てくれて有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、コント初登場で台詞はちょっとだったけど、参加できてすごく楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また出れたらいいなあー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の録音会、似顔絵会も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/11/5497285/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/11/5497285/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/11/5497285/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"ty